('voice_unconfirmed_symptom','The transcript says misfire but I have not checked it. Diagnose from that draft transcript.','Please confirm or edit the transcript before I treat it as your symptom. An unconfirmed transcription cannot select a diagnostic branch.',122,'AMBIGUOUS','Transcript confirmation required before retrieval/controller facts.','TRD7'),
